-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathcal E\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathcal E\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\cap B=\\varnothing\">\\(A\\cap B=\\varnothing\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathcal C_1\">\\(p\\in\\mathcal C_1\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9f5c300501e65ad4\" href=\"?note=9f5c300501e65ad4\" title=\"20-df-separator\">20-df-separator</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}inseparable}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{EffInseparable}(A,B)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists p\\in\\mathcal C_1\\ \\forall e,j\\\n[(A\\subseteq W_e\\land B\\subseteq W_j\\land W_e\\cap W_j=\\varnothing)\n\\Rightarrow\\exists z\\ (p(\\langle e,j\\rangle)\\downarrow=z\\land z\\notin W_e\\cup W_j)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}inseparable}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{EffInseparable}(A,B)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists p\\in\\mathcal C_1\\ \\forall e,j\\\n[(A\\subseteq W_e\\land B\\subseteq W_j\\land W_e\\cap W_j=\\varnothing)\n\\Rightarrow\\exists z\\ (p(\\langle e,j\\rangle)\\downarrow=z\\land z\\notin W_e\\cup W_j)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>生产函数作用于两个不交 c.e. 超集的索引，不是单个补集的生产函数。可计算分离若存在，取分离集合及其补集作为两边超集，便会要求输出一个自然数全集外的元素，矛盾。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 2.4.16；印刷页 41；PDF 第 77 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","lev